<section class="services-page">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <div class="page-identity">
      <img class="page-identity-mark" src="{{asset "images/download (25).jpg"}}" alt="Garcia Law Office and Notary Public seal logo">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">How we can help</p>
        <h1 class="page-title">Focused legal support for your next step.</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="services-intro">Atty. Lourdeserna Garcia, J.D. provides clear, careful legal assistance through Garcia Law Office and Notary Public.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="service-catalog">
      <article class="service-card">
        <span class="service-number">01</span>
        <h2>Legal consultation</h2>
        <p>Discuss your concern with a lawyer, understand your options, and identify the appropriate next step.</p>
        <p class="service-note">Bring a short timeline and any documents related to your concern.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="service-card">
        <span class="service-number">02</span>
        <h2>Notarial services</h2>
        <p>Notarial services for affidavits, acknowledgments, contracts, authorizations, sworn statements, and other documents requiring notarization.</p>
        <p class="service-note">Please bring a valid government-issued ID and the complete document.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="service-card">
        <span class="service-number">03</span>
        <h2>Contracts and agreements</h2>
