        <p class="service-note">We help make important terms clear before you sign.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="service-card">
        <span class="service-number">04</span>
        <h2>Legal representation</h2>
        <p>Representation and legal support for matters requiring formal action, negotiation, or advocacy.</p>
        <p class="service-note">The appropriate scope depends on the facts, documents, and stage of the matter.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="fee-guide section-border">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fee-guide-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Indicative fee guide</p>
        <h2>Common services and estimated ranges.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>These ranges are for initial planning. The office will confirm the applicable fee and scope after reviewing the request.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fee-table-wrap">
      <table class="fee-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th scope="col">Transaction or service</th><th scope="col">Estimated range</th><th scope="col">What may affect the fee</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Initial legal consultation</td><td>PHP 500-1,500</td><td>Time, urgency, and complexity of the concern</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Follow-up consultation</td><td>PHP 300-800</td><td>Additional questions, documents, or review time</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Document review and explanation</td><td>PHP 500-1,500</td><td>Length, technical terms, and number of documents</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Affidavit preparation or review</td><td>PHP 300-1,000</td><td>Number of pages, facts, and required revisions</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Notarization of a simple document</td><td>PHP 150-500</td><td>Document type, signatories, witnesses, and copies</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Authorization or special power of attorney</td><td>PHP 500-1,500</td><td>Parties, subject matter, and notarization requirements</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Simple contract or agreement</td><td>PHP 800-2,000</td><td>Length, revisions, parties, and subject matter</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Contract review with revisions</td><td>PHP 1,000-2,500</td><td>Risk assessment, negotiation points, and document length</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Demand letter or formal correspondence</td><td>PHP 1,000-3,000</td><td>Research, supporting records, and urgency</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Written legal guidance or opinion</td><td>PHP 1,500-3,000</td><td>Research required, issues involved, and requested detail</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Initial assessment for negotiation or representation</td><td>PHP 1,000-3,000</td><td>Stage of the matter, records, urgency, and expected work</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="fee-notice"><strong>Fee reminder:</strong> Prices are estimates and may change depending on the facts, complexity, urgency, document length, number of parties, travel, witnesses, revisions, and other requests. Full representation, court appearances, filing costs, government fees, transportation, and other third-party expenses may require a separate quotation and are not automatically included above.</div>
  </div>
</section>

